+### Planned model integrity and personalization
+
+ADR-0023 requires `model.toml` to record each model file's URL, size and SHA-256,
+base model and license, training run (pipeline commit and dataset hash), and
+quantization. The installer downloads only at install or explicit update into
+`$XDG_DATA_HOME/nl-shell/models/` and verifies SHA-256 before use. The REPL must
+refuse to load a weight file whose hash does not match the active target's manifest.
+There are no runtime downloads; offline operation remains required.
+
+Personalization adapters are stored per target and base-weight hash and are
+not loaded on different weights. These integrity and compatibility requirements,
+the manifest and the installer are planned, not implemented by the existing loaders.
